1
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:49,680
President Xiang, Mr. Wei.

2
00:01:50,519 --> 00:01:52,319
Three workers from the base have gone missing.

3
00:01:52,599 --> 00:01:54,359
They were likely kidnapped by militants.

4
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:57,079
Take a few men

5
00:01:57,120 --> 00:01:58,879
and check the base perimeter first.

6
00:01:59,079 --> 00:02:00,640
See if there's anyone suspicious.

7
00:02:00,640 --> 00:02:01,319
Yes, sir.

8
00:02:11,400 --> 00:02:12,599
This is Zhong'an Group.

9
00:02:12,599 --> 00:02:13,960
A Chinese-run security company.

10
00:02:13,960 --> 00:02:15,439
They all know kung fu. They're amazing.

11
00:02:15,439 --> 00:02:16,280
Trust them.

12
00:02:20,639 --> 00:02:22,879
Do you know where your sisters are held?

13
00:02:24,159 --> 00:02:25,520
Will you take us to them?

14
00:02:25,960 --> 00:02:27,240
I want the Silent Protectors.

15
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,439
She wants to find the Silent Protectors.

16
00:02:32,439 --> 00:02:33,479
Yet you had to bring her here.

17
00:02:33,479 --> 00:02:34,319
What do we do now?

18
00:02:36,199 --> 00:02:37,000
Listen to me.

19
00:02:37,479 --> 00:02:38,479
We at Zhong'an Group

20
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:40,120
are also a major security company.

21
00:02:40,560 --> 00:02:42,479
We're capable of rescuing your sisters.

22
00:02:42,599 --> 00:02:44,439
Please take us there. Trust us.

23
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,719
Regardless of race or nationality,

24
00:02:47,800 --> 00:02:50,280
regardless of skin color, we are here.

25
00:02:52,080 --> 00:02:53,759
We at Zhong'an have our own creed:

26
00:02:54,159 --> 00:02:56,520
"Life protects life." Trust us.

27
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:01,120
Wei Tian, only Silent Protectors can help.

28
00:03:11,039 --> 00:03:11,680
Come here, quick!

29
00:03:12,199 --> 00:03:13,520
Look at this. What happened?

30
00:03:15,439 --> 00:03:16,280
Someone cut it.

31
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:17,280
Sawed right through.

32
00:03:17,599 --> 00:03:18,240
Yeah.

33
00:03:20,879 --> 00:03:23,319
No power, no water.

34
00:03:23,479 --> 00:03:24,759
Construction is completely impossible.

35
00:03:25,439 --> 00:03:27,039
We need to get someone to fix it now.

36
00:03:27,039 --> 00:03:27,960
Fixing it won't do any good.

37
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,120
If they come back and saw it again,

38
00:03:29,439 --> 00:03:30,520
won't it end up the same?

39
00:03:30,520 --> 00:03:31,319
True.

40
00:03:31,680 --> 00:03:33,680
Our top priority is finding the culprits.

41
00:03:36,120 --> 00:03:37,159
That'll take some time.

42
00:03:39,520 --> 00:03:42,080
You see, our power system

43
00:03:42,080 --> 00:03:43,479
keeps getting sabotaged by militants.

44
00:03:44,240 --> 00:03:46,520
So the project had to be halted.

45
00:03:48,400 --> 00:03:49,400
With the project on hold,

46
00:03:49,400 --> 00:03:51,319
where did the idle workers go?

47
00:03:51,479 --> 00:03:52,599
Where else could they go?

48
00:03:52,719 --> 00:03:54,240
Back to wherever they came from.

49
00:03:54,280 --> 00:03:55,400
Nobody wanted to hang around here.

50
00:03:55,479 --> 00:03:57,400
Hanging around just meant taking a beating.

51
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:59,479
Right after our base was set up,

52
00:03:59,520 --> 00:04:00,840
the militants showed up.

53
00:04:01,080 --> 00:04:02,280
First they threatened us,

54
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:04,639
then beat and drove off the local workers.

55
00:04:06,560 --> 00:04:08,840
The situation is worse than we thought.

56
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:17,560
Help!

57
00:04:18,560 --> 00:04:20,800
Help! Help me!

58
00:04:23,519 --> 00:04:24,319
My leg!

59
00:04:25,199 --> 00:04:25,759
Help me!

60
00:04:25,759 --> 00:04:26,800
Are you okay? Come on.

61
00:04:27,199 --> 00:04:27,920
My leg!

62
00:04:27,920 --> 00:04:28,680
Help him up.

63
00:04:29,759 --> 00:04:31,800
Careful. Let's go.

64
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:32,959
Help me!

65
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:34,199
Are you okay?

66
00:04:35,199 --> 00:04:36,000
It's a landmine.

67
00:04:36,600 --> 00:04:37,920
How could there be landmines here?

68
00:04:38,319 --> 00:04:39,120
How does it look?

69
00:04:39,879 --> 00:04:42,319
This hole was dug very shallow.

70
00:04:43,279 --> 00:04:47,040
Looks newly dug, and very rushed.

71
00:04:48,959 --> 00:04:50,600
What are these people up to?

72
00:04:51,519 --> 00:04:52,600
There might be more than one.

73
00:04:52,839 --> 00:04:54,160
Let's get everyone evacuated right now.

74
00:04:57,480 --> 00:04:58,759
Everyone, evacuate the area!

75
00:04:58,759 --> 00:05:00,079
Get the wounded onto the ambulance!

76
00:05:00,079 --> 00:05:00,439
Come on.

77
00:05:00,439 --> 00:05:00,800
Okay.

78
00:05:00,800 --> 00:05:01,319
Quick, quick!

79
00:05:03,240 --> 00:05:03,439
Come on.

80
00:05:03,439 --> 00:05:03,800
Wei Tian!

81
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:04,160
Easy now.

82
00:05:04,160 --> 00:05:05,079
I'm going over there to check.

83
00:05:07,279 --> 00:05:09,560
Captain, we'll stay behind

84
00:05:10,360 --> 00:05:12,720
and find a way to get deminers here first.

85
00:05:13,519 --> 00:05:16,160
Otherwise, the workers won't come back.

86
00:05:18,240 --> 00:05:19,040
Wei Tian!

87
00:05:21,040 --> 00:05:21,839
Wei Tian!

88
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:23,279
Wei Tian!

89
00:05:33,439 --> 00:05:34,000
Watch out!

90
00:05:35,839 --> 00:05:36,519
I see it.

91
00:05:46,000 --> 00:05:47,040
Take cover first.

92
00:05:47,040 --> 00:05:47,839
Be careful.

93
00:05:48,560 --> 00:05:49,639
Come on, let's go.

94
00:05:55,120 --> 00:05:56,319
Let's take a gamble.

95
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:31,000
You're really lucky.

96
00:06:32,519 --> 00:06:34,600
If you still want to save your sisters,

97
00:06:34,879 --> 00:06:36,759
Zhong'an is your only hope right now.

98
00:06:39,279 --> 00:06:42,000
If you believe Wei Tian can work miracles,

99
00:06:42,000 --> 00:06:43,680
then he's the one who'll give you hope.

100
00:06:48,319 --> 00:06:50,680
We saved you from the red-light district,

101
00:06:50,680 --> 00:06:51,959
and we can save your sisters too.

102
00:06:51,959 --> 00:06:53,079
We'd never lie to you.

103
00:06:54,519 --> 00:06:55,959
Please, put your trust in Zhong'an.

104
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:02,560
About this matter,

105
00:07:02,560 --> 00:07:04,360
we should probably let Wei Tian know.

106
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:20,560
No one's answering.

107
00:07:22,279 --> 00:07:23,879
I'll just contact Rossi directly.

108
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:36,680
Rossi, what's the situation on your end?

109
00:07:37,319 --> 00:07:39,199
Their signal has already been cut off.

110
00:07:39,519 --> 00:07:40,720
We're on high frequency,

111
00:07:40,800 --> 00:07:41,839
so we can still connect.

112
00:07:43,120 --> 00:07:44,680
Is Sissoko behind this?

113
00:07:44,879 --> 00:07:46,079
Who is Sissoko?

114
00:07:46,079 --> 00:07:47,800
Sissoko is a militant

115
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:48,959
operating near the Huatie base.

116
00:07:49,560 --> 00:07:50,879
Put me through to Wei Tian.

117
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,399
We rescued a girl

118
00:07:55,399 --> 00:07:57,000
who escaped from the red-light district.

119
00:07:57,600 --> 00:07:59,279
She said the tribe near the Huatie base

120
00:07:59,279 --> 00:08:01,279
is controlled by someone named Sissoko.

121
00:08:02,680 --> 00:08:03,879
The comms being cut off,

122
00:08:03,879 --> 00:08:05,560
does it have something to do with Sissoko?

123
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:06,800
It's possible.

124
00:08:07,720 --> 00:08:10,639
The girl insists on Silent Protectors.

125
00:08:11,680 --> 00:08:14,959
I'll send people over. Wait for me.

126
00:08:16,399 --> 00:08:17,199
Understood.

127
00:08:21,839 --> 00:08:23,439
Rossi, Sha Lan,

128
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,920
go give Xiang Lai a hand.

129
00:08:27,800 --> 00:08:28,600
All right, copy that.

130
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:30,040
Copy.

131
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:48,440
Grace, I need your help with something.

132
00:09:38,240 --> 00:09:39,720
Thank you for coming back to help.

133
00:09:40,240 --> 00:09:41,159
It's our duty.

134
00:09:41,960 --> 00:09:43,399
According to Grace's intel,

135
00:09:43,559 --> 00:09:44,679
the girls from the tribe

136
00:09:44,679 --> 00:09:45,360
will be moved out

137
00:09:45,360 --> 00:09:47,120
of Antilocaris tonight.

138
00:09:47,720 --> 00:09:48,519
What do we do now?

139
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,080
Erika said

140
00:09:50,360 --> 00:09:53,000
the black market hired terrorist guards,

141
00:09:53,000 --> 00:09:54,559
and they're keeping a very low profile.

142
00:09:55,559 --> 00:09:56,960
Xiang Lai, we can't wait any longer.

143
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,759
Otherwise, it'll really be too late.

144
00:09:59,440 --> 00:10:00,240
Rossi,

145
00:10:01,000 --> 00:10:02,240
I hope you and Sha Lan

146
00:10:02,399 --> 00:10:03,960
can give us your full support this time.

147
00:10:05,639 --> 00:10:06,440
Count me in too.

148
00:10:06,440 --> 00:10:07,120
No way.

149
00:10:08,559 --> 00:10:09,559
Why not?

150
00:10:09,759 --> 00:10:12,039
Uncle Qu taught me knives, you defense,

151
00:10:12,039 --> 00:10:13,080
and Wei Tian taught me how to shoot.

152
00:10:13,080 --> 00:10:13,919
I'm ready.

153
00:10:14,039 --> 00:10:16,080
Training is nothing like real combat.

154
00:10:17,399 --> 00:10:18,879
We can't let you take that risk.

155
00:10:19,240 --> 00:10:20,039
Exactly.

156
00:10:20,720 --> 00:10:21,919
What we're facing this time

157
00:10:21,919 --> 00:10:23,840
is a group of armed terrorists.

158
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:26,159
No combat experience. It's too dangerous.

159
00:10:26,200 --> 00:10:27,759
I'd feel better if you stayed here.

160
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,000
Personally, I think

161
00:10:30,440 --> 00:10:32,360
this could be a good learning opportunity.

162
00:10:32,879 --> 00:10:34,440
Anda doesn't have to join the rescue.

163
00:10:34,799 --> 00:10:36,240
She can assist me with this.

164
00:10:46,360 --> 00:10:47,960
Keep a close eye on those girls.

165
00:10:48,120 --> 00:10:49,120
Don't let anything go wrong.

166
00:10:49,360 --> 00:10:50,120
Don't worry.

167
00:10:50,120 --> 00:10:51,840
We won't be careless like last time.

168
00:10:52,279 --> 00:10:53,799
Someone will come at three this afternoon

169
00:10:54,039 --> 00:10:55,879
to help us move these girls.

170
00:10:56,039 --> 00:10:57,559
Sissoko specifically instructed me

171
00:10:57,559 --> 00:10:59,320
not to let a single girl escape.

172
00:10:59,320 --> 00:10:59,960
Got it?

173
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:00,559
Got it.

174
00:11:00,559 --> 00:11:02,600
Don't drink too much. Stay sharp.

175
00:11:02,879 --> 00:11:03,720
Don't worry.

176
00:11:14,960 --> 00:11:15,840
At three this afternoon,

177
00:11:16,120 --> 00:11:18,399
Sissoko's men will move the girls.

178
00:11:28,279 --> 00:11:30,919
Why send him alone for this?

179
00:11:31,720 --> 00:11:33,720
No one else knows how to handle it.

180
00:11:34,320 --> 00:11:35,200
Will he be okay?

181
00:11:36,919 --> 00:11:38,799
Come on, don't you have any faith in him?

182
00:11:39,840 --> 00:11:42,200
Who said that? He's the one I trust most.

183
00:11:43,440 --> 00:11:44,240
Really?

184
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:49,559
Then why are you pinching me so hard?

185
00:11:51,440 --> 00:11:52,840
You need to trim your nails.

186
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:54,799
How's it going?

187
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,759
He's still planting those little flags.

188
00:11:58,399 --> 00:12:00,320
Wei Tian, what's the situation?

189
00:12:00,679 --> 00:12:01,480
Fall back!

190
00:12:01,679 --> 00:12:02,480
Copy that.

191
00:12:03,120 --> 00:12:04,759
Fall back! Back to the vehicles!

192
00:12:06,039 --> 00:12:07,919
Everyone, fall back!

193
00:12:08,559 --> 00:12:09,480
Take cover!

194
00:12:10,080 --> 00:12:10,879
Move!

195
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:55,679
What happens when you cross us...

196
00:12:55,679 --> 00:12:57,399
...you should know full well.

197
00:12:58,759 --> 00:13:00,879
Stop looking so miserable.

198
00:13:02,159 --> 00:13:03,879
Your rescuers are already here.

199
00:13:16,039 --> 00:13:16,919
At three this afternoon,

200
00:13:17,279 --> 00:13:19,120
all the girls will be moved by vehicle.

201
00:13:25,320 --> 00:13:26,639
Can we confirm which vehicle?

202
00:13:28,679 --> 00:13:30,240
According to Grace's intel,

203
00:13:30,440 --> 00:13:31,720
the second vehicle in the first row,

204
00:13:31,799 --> 00:13:33,200
the sixth in the third row,

205
00:13:33,200 --> 00:13:34,559
and the fourth in the fourth row...

206
00:13:37,679 --> 00:13:39,720
Which one will they actually use?

207
00:13:58,720 --> 00:14:00,840
Xiang Lai, we're at the front gate now.

208
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:02,120
We've locked onto several cars.

209
00:14:02,120 --> 00:14:04,200
Which one gets the tracker?

210
00:14:05,799 --> 00:14:07,360
Shouldn't we just plant trackers

211
00:14:07,360 --> 00:14:08,480
on all the vehicles?

212
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,120
Hold on, don't rush.

213
00:14:10,519 --> 00:14:11,799
I still need to confirm something.

214
00:14:28,080 --> 00:14:28,879
Bring them out.

215
00:14:38,840 --> 00:14:39,600
Don't move!

216
00:14:39,600 --> 00:14:40,320
Freeze!

217
00:14:40,519 --> 00:14:41,320
Don't move!

218
00:14:47,720 --> 00:14:49,840
Take the woman inside. Hurry!

219
00:14:53,519 --> 00:14:54,320
Freeze!

220
00:14:54,679 --> 00:14:55,480
Who are you looking for?

221
00:14:57,679 --> 00:14:58,519
You bastard!

222
00:14:58,720 --> 00:15:00,320
Chasing women behind my back all day!

223
00:15:00,799 --> 00:15:01,960
How could you do this?

224
00:15:02,399 --> 00:15:03,679
Move! Get going!

225
00:15:03,759 --> 00:15:04,240
Get out of here!

226
00:15:04,440 --> 00:15:05,799
Just wait until we get home!

227
00:15:06,440 --> 00:15:08,399
Cheating behind my back! Let's go!

228
00:15:17,440 --> 00:15:18,759
Get up there, hurry!

229
00:15:18,879 --> 00:15:19,679
Hurry up!

230
00:15:20,399 --> 00:15:21,559
Quick, get up there!

231
00:15:22,519 --> 00:15:23,320
Move!

232
00:15:36,399 --> 00:15:37,200
Sha Lan

233
00:16:12,879 --> 00:16:14,559
Who are you? Stop right there!

234
00:16:15,320 --> 00:16:17,039
Don't move! What are you doing?

235
00:16:17,759 --> 00:16:18,559
Talk!

236
00:16:19,759 --> 00:16:20,559
What do you want?

237
00:16:20,720 --> 00:16:22,000
They outnumber us, and they're armed!

238
00:16:22,000 --> 00:16:23,200
Who are you really?

239
00:16:23,320 --> 00:16:24,600
Sha Lan isn't an ordinary girl.

240
00:16:24,639 --> 00:16:25,919
She knows how to protect herself.

241
00:16:27,480 --> 00:16:28,320
What's this?

242
00:16:28,799 --> 00:16:29,960
I don't know what you're talking about.

243
00:16:34,360 --> 00:16:35,240
What is this?

244
00:16:38,080 --> 00:16:39,240
Who were you talking to?

245
00:16:42,000 --> 00:16:42,360
Move!

246
00:16:42,960 --> 00:16:43,440
Move!

247
00:16:44,600 --> 00:16:46,399
We can't just watch them walk away!

248
00:16:47,200 --> 00:16:48,000
Don't do anything reckless!

249
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:51,200
Get in the car first. Move, move!

250
00:16:51,639 --> 00:16:52,440
Get in!

251
00:16:59,279 --> 00:17:00,080
Let's go.

252
00:17:10,440 --> 00:17:11,880
Anda, where are you?

253
00:17:14,119 --> 00:17:15,599
I've locked onto the target vehicle.

254
00:17:18,960 --> 00:17:20,480
The tracker hasn't activated.

255
00:17:29,079 --> 00:17:30,720
Anda, follow that car.

256
00:17:57,559 --> 00:17:59,319
If you want them to live,

257
00:18:00,039 --> 00:18:03,519
give the workers time off and leave here.

258
00:18:03,680 --> 00:18:05,759
I keep my word.

259
00:18:06,400 --> 00:18:08,559
I'll guarantee their lives.

260
00:18:09,880 --> 00:18:11,039
When did this get here?

261
00:18:11,640 --> 00:18:12,559
I don't know either.

262
00:18:12,680 --> 00:18:13,920
When I got back to the office,

263
00:18:14,200 --> 00:18:15,319
the computer was already here.

264
00:18:19,079 --> 00:18:20,079
It's Sissoko.

265
00:18:20,079 --> 00:18:20,880
You know him?

266
00:18:22,799 --> 00:18:25,079
He used to head my security detail.

267
00:18:25,240 --> 00:18:26,599
Later, he defected to Hades.

268
00:18:27,559 --> 00:18:28,799
He might still be nearby.

269
00:18:29,920 --> 00:18:30,720
Right.

270
00:18:31,160 --> 00:18:31,960
Shen Yu,

271
00:18:34,480 --> 00:18:36,400
take some men and search all nearby places

272
00:18:36,400 --> 00:18:37,319
where someone could be hiding.

273
00:18:37,799 --> 00:18:38,519
Stay safe.

274
00:18:38,519 --> 00:18:39,160
Understood.

275
00:18:47,799 --> 00:18:50,119
Can you tell where this was filmed?

276
00:18:51,480 --> 00:18:52,880
I know this place.

277
00:18:53,720 --> 00:18:55,319
I'll rescue the hostages right now.

278
00:18:55,799 --> 00:18:56,599
Marissa,

279
00:18:57,359 --> 00:18:59,319
you're not going in alone, are you?

280
00:19:11,359 --> 00:19:12,440
Don't be afraid, everyone.

281
00:19:12,680 --> 00:19:14,519
Trust me, someone will come save us.

282
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:19,039
Don't be scared.

283
00:19:20,160 --> 00:19:20,960
I'm right here.

284
00:19:21,119 --> 00:19:22,759
Trust me, someone will come save us.

285
00:19:52,240 --> 00:19:53,079
Go open the doors!

286
00:20:01,400 --> 00:20:02,720
Come on, don't be afraid.

287
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:03,920
They're here to save us!

288
00:20:04,279 --> 00:20:04,720
Quick!

289
00:20:05,200 --> 00:20:05,559
Okay.

290
00:20:06,240 --> 00:20:06,680
Get in!

291
00:20:06,680 --> 00:20:07,319
Thank goodness!

292
00:20:07,319 --> 00:20:08,440
Hurry, get in!

293
00:20:08,759 --> 00:20:09,240
Thank you!

294
00:20:09,240 --> 00:20:09,799
Hurry, hurry!

295
00:20:23,039 --> 00:20:23,839
Keep up.

296
00:20:27,480 --> 00:20:27,880
Come on.

297
00:20:30,279 --> 00:20:30,720
Move.

298
00:20:33,359 --> 00:20:33,720
Let's go.

299
00:20:37,759 --> 00:20:39,279
Be careful on the road. Drive slow.

300
00:20:39,480 --> 00:20:40,160
Stay safe.

301
00:20:40,960 --> 00:20:41,400
Go.

302
00:20:45,960 --> 00:20:46,400
Any luck?

303
00:20:46,720 --> 00:20:47,759
Can't find Marissa.

304
00:20:48,880 --> 00:20:51,160
I bet she went off on her own

305
00:20:51,160 --> 00:20:52,039
to the tribe.

306
00:20:52,720 --> 00:20:53,640
That woman...

307
00:20:54,519 --> 00:20:55,559
Then we have to go too.

308
00:20:55,799 --> 00:20:56,160
Right.

309
00:20:56,440 --> 00:20:56,799
Let's go.

310
00:20:57,039 --> 00:20:58,400
Hold on, let me grab a weapon.

311
00:22:18,079 --> 00:22:18,880
Thank you.

312
00:22:19,480 --> 00:22:20,279
Thank you.

313
00:22:21,960 --> 00:22:22,720
Erika.

314
00:22:23,240 --> 00:22:23,480
This is wonderful.

315
00:22:23,480 --> 00:22:25,480
It's so good to see you again.

316
00:22:28,440 --> 00:22:29,240
Thank you.

317
00:22:29,400 --> 00:22:30,920
You saved my sisters.

318
00:22:30,920 --> 00:22:31,480
Erika.

319
00:22:31,480 --> 00:22:32,640
I'm so grateful to you all.

320
00:22:33,119 --> 00:22:34,680
Thank you so much. Really.

321
00:22:37,279 --> 00:22:38,079
Xiang Lai.

322
00:22:38,480 --> 00:22:40,720
Sha Lan and I will escort them to town

323
00:22:40,759 --> 00:22:41,839
and hand them over to the police.

324
00:22:42,400 --> 00:22:43,960
All right. Stay safe.

325
00:22:44,680 --> 00:22:45,480
Let's go.

326
00:23:40,400 --> 00:23:41,240
Go inside first.

327
00:23:41,240 --> 00:23:42,000
I'll stay outside.

328
00:23:48,640 --> 00:23:50,680
I've been waiting for this day.

329
00:23:52,039 --> 00:23:52,839
Did you think...

330
00:23:52,960 --> 00:23:55,079
you had what it takes to catch me?

331
00:23:55,559 --> 00:23:56,319
Fine.

332
00:23:57,559 --> 00:23:59,000
I'd like to see...

333
00:23:59,000 --> 00:24:00,640
what tricks you can pull this time.

334
00:24:01,119 --> 00:24:02,039
I came here...

335
00:24:02,119 --> 00:24:03,640
to urge you to lay down your gun,

336
00:24:03,839 --> 00:24:05,160
and leave Hades immediately.

337
00:24:05,440 --> 00:24:06,920
Otherwise, only death awaits you, too.

338
00:24:07,200 --> 00:24:09,440
Shut up! You have no right to lecture me.

339
00:24:09,599 --> 00:24:10,720
You're just like me.

340
00:24:10,799 --> 00:24:12,599
You can never truly leave the battlefield.

341
00:24:12,599 --> 00:24:14,240
We've both lived by the gun.

342
00:24:14,279 --> 00:24:15,920
Without it, we don't feel safe.

343
00:24:15,920 --> 00:24:17,359
You said a gun is life.

344
00:24:17,359 --> 00:24:19,160
Put it down, and you lose your life.

345
00:24:19,440 --> 00:24:21,559
I've put mine down. You can, too.

346
00:25:41,880 --> 00:25:43,920
Don't be afraid, I'm here to rescue you.

347
00:25:44,440 --> 00:25:45,480
Follow me quietly.

348
00:25:48,880 --> 00:25:49,720
Untie them.

349
00:25:49,960 --> 00:25:50,480
Okay.

350
00:25:52,079 --> 00:25:52,640
Thank you.

351
00:25:54,799 --> 00:25:55,160
Come on.

352
00:25:56,839 --> 00:25:57,400
Thank you.

353
00:25:58,000 --> 00:25:58,680
Stay quiet.

354
00:25:59,119 --> 00:25:59,720
Go, go, go.

355
00:26:56,000 --> 00:26:56,440
Dad,

356
00:26:56,799 --> 00:26:57,759
how are things over there?

357
00:26:58,119 --> 00:26:59,119
I've already rescued

358
00:26:59,119 --> 00:27:00,559
three kidnapped hostages.

359
00:27:01,279 --> 00:27:02,079
What about you?

360
00:27:06,079 --> 00:27:06,880
Get down!

361
00:27:09,559 --> 00:27:09,880
Dad!

362
00:27:11,680 --> 00:27:12,119
Dad!

363
00:27:13,720 --> 00:27:14,440
Where are you going?

364
00:27:14,440 --> 00:27:15,480
Huatie Construction Base.

365
00:27:29,559 --> 00:27:30,359
Hurry, go!

366
00:28:12,240 --> 00:28:12,960
Wei Tian

367
00:28:26,240 --> 00:28:27,039
Marissa.

368
00:28:30,359 --> 00:28:30,880
Are you okay?

369
00:28:32,359 --> 00:28:32,720
Let's go.

370
00:28:42,359 --> 00:28:43,440
Contact the reporters right away.

371
00:28:43,440 --> 00:28:43,880
Right away.

372
00:28:43,880 --> 00:28:45,960
Announce that the base

373
00:28:45,960 --> 00:28:46,839
has resumed normal operations.

374
00:28:46,839 --> 00:28:47,559
Understood.

375
00:28:48,319 --> 00:28:49,440
Have you checked the perimeter?

376
00:28:49,680 --> 00:28:50,400
We have.

377
00:28:50,400 --> 00:28:51,200
Any problems?

378
00:28:51,200 --> 00:28:51,960
None.

379
00:28:51,960 --> 00:28:54,079
Good. Make sure nothing goes wrong.

380
00:28:54,200 --> 00:28:55,000
Yes, sir.

381
00:29:12,359 --> 00:29:13,319
Get out!

382
00:29:29,359 --> 00:29:31,279
Not clashing with Hades head-on...

383
00:29:31,400 --> 00:29:32,799
feels a bit disappointing, doesn't it?

384
00:29:34,319 --> 00:29:35,119
Regrets?

385
00:29:36,279 --> 00:29:38,960
There'll always be some, no matter what.

386
00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:42,559
Sometimes I wonder...

387
00:29:43,640 --> 00:29:44,960
am I really helping people,

388
00:29:45,640 --> 00:29:47,079
or just dragging them down?

389
00:29:49,079 --> 00:29:51,400
If you hesitate, don't do this job.

390
00:29:52,799 --> 00:29:55,400
Bullets won't give you time to think.

391
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:01,720
See?

392
00:30:02,559 --> 00:30:04,519
You didn't hesitate at all.

393
00:30:08,200 --> 00:30:08,759
Get in the car.

394
00:30:09,039 --> 00:30:09,519
All right.

395
00:30:29,319 --> 00:30:30,440
How are you doing?

396
00:30:31,440 --> 00:30:32,440
Xiang Lai told me

397
00:30:32,960 --> 00:30:34,640
you've run into a lot of trouble.

398
00:30:35,799 --> 00:30:38,119
I'm starting to understand how you think,

399
00:30:38,720 --> 00:30:39,720
your work,

400
00:30:40,519 --> 00:30:43,160
and the dangers that come with it.

401
00:30:47,519 --> 00:30:48,519
Lately,

402
00:30:49,079 --> 00:30:51,359
Xiang Lai took Rossi, Sha Lan, and me

403
00:30:51,799 --> 00:30:53,960
to help a girl from a tribe

404
00:30:54,039 --> 00:30:55,640
named Erika.

405
00:30:56,839 --> 00:30:58,640
It was quite a thrilling mission.

406
00:30:59,319 --> 00:31:00,440
I've started trying

407
00:31:00,640 --> 00:31:02,440
to live like a Silent Protector.

408
00:31:07,000 --> 00:31:08,480
I wanted you to know.

409
00:31:25,720 --> 00:31:26,400
Recently,

410
00:31:26,400 --> 00:31:28,880
in Antilocaris, Africa, Zhong'an Group

411
00:31:28,880 --> 00:31:30,440
successfully worked with local forces

412
00:31:30,440 --> 00:31:32,559
to rescue the Huatie project hostages.

413
00:31:32,839 --> 00:31:35,200
Here's the report from our field reporter.

414
00:31:49,039 --> 00:31:51,640
Dad, what made you think of calling me?

415
00:31:52,079 --> 00:31:53,440
I saw the news from over there.

416
00:31:53,480 --> 00:31:54,960
You must've had a rough time.

417
00:31:56,799 --> 00:31:57,720
Reporting, Commander!

418
00:31:58,119 --> 00:32:00,119
Security Officer Xiang Bei fears nothing!

419
00:32:00,119 --> 00:32:01,240
Always learning from you!

420
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:02,960
Currently on standby at home,

421
00:32:02,960 --> 00:32:04,279
eagerly awaiting the next mission!

422
00:32:05,759 --> 00:32:07,119
Since you're back at headquarters,

423
00:32:07,799 --> 00:32:09,640
take a good rest for a while.

424
00:32:10,000 --> 00:32:12,759
Don't worry, we'll need you soon enough.

425
00:32:15,759 --> 00:32:17,559
Dad, in the next few days,

426
00:32:17,559 --> 00:32:20,240
I want to visit you guys in Antilocaris.

427
00:32:20,400 --> 00:32:22,400
You know I've been learning to cook.

428
00:32:22,400 --> 00:32:24,079
I haven't shown off my skills to you yet.

429
00:32:24,160 --> 00:32:27,400
No. The situation here changes rapidly.

430
00:32:28,640 --> 00:32:31,000
Besides, I'm no longer in Supeduo.

431
00:32:31,519 --> 00:32:33,119
Dad, where are you off to now?

432
00:32:34,440 --> 00:32:35,519
I'm currently on my way

433
00:32:35,519 --> 00:32:37,359
to the African Security Conference.

434
00:32:37,839 --> 00:32:38,640
All right,

435
00:32:39,000 --> 00:32:41,440
that's enough commendation over the phone.

436
00:32:41,839 --> 00:32:42,799
Keep up the good work.

437
00:33:20,799 --> 00:33:22,440
Xiang... Xiang Pingsheng!

438
00:33:26,039 --> 00:33:27,359
Hello, Xiang Pingsheng.

439
00:33:28,599 --> 00:33:29,480
Douglas!

440
00:33:29,599 --> 00:33:30,480
In the flesh!

441
00:33:31,440 --> 00:33:32,960
Where have you been all this time?

442
00:33:32,960 --> 00:33:34,440
I never expected it was you!

443
00:33:35,279 --> 00:33:36,119
Long time no see.

444
00:33:36,119 --> 00:33:38,799
Long time no see! You've put on weight.

445
00:33:39,920 --> 00:33:42,599
You could say I let myself go.

446
00:33:42,599 --> 00:33:45,240
Still cute and handsome though, right?

447
00:33:45,240 --> 00:33:46,880
Yeah, very handsome. Very cute.

448
00:33:46,880 --> 00:33:48,799
Thank you, thank you.

449
00:33:49,160 --> 00:33:51,279
So, are you here for the conference?

450
00:33:51,279 --> 00:33:51,880
Yes, I am.

451
00:33:52,480 --> 00:33:54,319
I never expected to run into you here.

452
00:33:54,640 --> 00:33:57,160
After you left the peacekeeping forces,

453
00:33:57,160 --> 00:33:58,799
returned to China, and founded Zhong'an,

454
00:33:58,799 --> 00:34:00,599
you never reached out to me once.

455
00:34:00,599 --> 00:34:01,400
True, true.

456
00:34:01,880 --> 00:34:03,240
You didn't contact me either.

457
00:34:04,119 --> 00:34:05,119
Fair enough.

458
00:34:06,039 --> 00:34:07,000
This time,

459
00:34:07,680 --> 00:34:09,559
I'm representing Zhong'an Security Group

460
00:34:09,920 --> 00:34:10,960
at this conference.

461
00:34:12,320 --> 00:34:13,880
Before this, in Africa,

462
00:34:13,880 --> 00:34:15,719
the demand for security has been huge.

463
00:34:16,159 --> 00:34:17,360
So I hope in the future,

464
00:34:17,360 --> 00:34:20,480
we'll have many chances to work together.

465
00:34:20,480 --> 00:34:21,119
Sounds good.

466
00:34:21,360 --> 00:34:22,000
Great.

467
00:34:22,079 --> 00:34:22,760
It's a deal.

468
00:34:22,920 --> 00:34:23,880
It's a deal.

469
00:34:24,599 --> 00:34:26,960
Africa's economy has huge growth potential

470
00:34:27,480 --> 00:34:29,039
and is favored worldwide.

471
00:34:29,920 --> 00:34:32,000
Companies and people from many nations

472
00:34:32,320 --> 00:34:34,480
came to Africa to pursue great ambitions.

473
00:34:34,760 --> 00:34:36,239
China is no exception.

474
00:34:37,239 --> 00:34:38,199
As we all know,

475
00:34:39,119 --> 00:34:40,639
China and Africa

476
00:34:41,079 --> 00:34:43,679
share a deep traditional friendship

477
00:34:44,360 --> 00:34:47,559
spanning over half a century.

478
00:34:48,519 --> 00:34:51,119
As Chinese enterprises grow in Africa,

479
00:34:51,360 --> 00:34:53,119
more Chinese people will

480
00:34:53,559 --> 00:34:55,800
come to Africa to live and work.

481
00:34:56,440 --> 00:34:57,679
We at Zhong'an Group

482
00:34:58,000 --> 00:35:01,480
aim to build a security shield

483
00:35:01,719 --> 00:35:03,360
to protect Chinese enterprises

484
00:35:03,360 --> 00:35:05,880
and Chinese citizens' lives and property.

485
00:35:05,880 --> 00:35:06,480
Great.

486
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:13,800
It's settled then. Catch you later.

487
00:35:21,119 --> 00:35:21,679
All right.

488
00:35:23,559 --> 00:35:24,400
Mr. Xiang.

489
00:35:25,760 --> 00:35:28,199
Are you used to this food?

490
00:35:29,119 --> 00:35:30,519
Of course I am.

491
00:35:31,079 --> 00:35:31,960
Familiar taste.

492
00:35:34,719 --> 00:35:35,559
Mr. Xiang.

493
00:35:36,159 --> 00:35:37,079
I heard

494
00:35:37,480 --> 00:35:40,119
that during the hostage rescue,

495
00:35:40,760 --> 00:35:43,039
you pulled some local strings.

496
00:35:43,840 --> 00:35:44,679
Let me tell you,

497
00:35:45,039 --> 00:35:46,320
that Wei Tian...

498
00:35:47,000 --> 00:35:49,280
he's crossed a lot of people locally.

499
00:35:49,440 --> 00:35:51,840
You must be careful working with him.

500
00:35:52,559 --> 00:35:55,400
Douglas, you and I are friends,

501
00:35:56,079 --> 00:35:57,719
and Wei Tian is my friend too.

502
00:35:58,519 --> 00:35:59,320
Back then,

503
00:36:00,679 --> 00:36:02,800
the hostage rescue was tricky.

504
00:36:03,400 --> 00:36:05,119
He and Qu Shengli helped me out.

505
00:36:05,400 --> 00:36:07,760
I'm deeply grateful to him.

506
00:36:09,119 --> 00:36:11,800
If you help me in a tight spot,

507
00:36:12,320 --> 00:36:14,719
I'll be just as grateful to you.

508
00:36:15,360 --> 00:36:16,800
Well, in that case,

509
00:36:17,239 --> 00:36:19,559
I truly hope I can be of help to you.

510
00:36:19,599 --> 00:36:21,559
We help each other out, right?

511
00:36:22,079 --> 00:36:24,719
I hope we can collaborate long-term.

512
00:36:25,119 --> 00:36:26,119
It's a deal.

513
00:36:26,280 --> 00:36:27,559
It's a deal.

514
00:36:28,039 --> 00:36:29,480
Great. Cheers!

515
00:36:31,840 --> 00:36:32,960
We at Zhong'an Group...

516
00:36:33,360 --> 00:36:35,400
Zhong'an is making big moves again.

517
00:36:37,679 --> 00:36:39,719
We've got ourselves another competitor.

518
00:36:40,119 --> 00:36:41,079
How about this?

519
00:36:41,400 --> 00:36:43,000
We could branch out our business too.

520
00:36:43,159 --> 00:36:45,159
Run some security training or something.

521
00:36:45,360 --> 00:36:46,960
Captain, training?

522
00:36:47,719 --> 00:36:49,199
You'd be teaching them

523
00:36:49,199 --> 00:36:50,800
how to be a good sniper.

524
00:36:54,760 --> 00:36:56,239
That'd waste way too much ammo.

525
00:36:56,840 --> 00:36:57,920
Let's try something else.

526
00:37:06,880 --> 00:37:07,400
Hello.

527
00:37:19,599 --> 00:37:21,599
Back when we were signing with Zhong'an,

528
00:37:21,800 --> 00:37:23,119
Xiao Chuan refused no matter what.

529
00:37:24,639 --> 00:37:25,440
Claiming that

530
00:37:25,440 --> 00:37:27,599
small private security firms were useless,

531
00:37:27,719 --> 00:37:29,880
and Xiang Lai's size didn't inspire trust.

532
00:37:30,159 --> 00:37:31,119
Look at him now,

533
00:37:31,119 --> 00:37:32,559
promoting it so enthusiastically.

534
00:37:34,840 --> 00:37:37,199
It's one way to boost revenue.

535
00:37:37,880 --> 00:37:38,880
A guy like Xiao Chuan

536
00:37:38,880 --> 00:37:41,000
would do anything for money.

537
00:37:41,519 --> 00:37:43,480
But lately, the guests checking in

538
00:37:43,480 --> 00:37:45,280
and making reservations are all Chinese.

539
00:37:48,079 --> 00:37:49,960
If it keeps up like this,

540
00:37:50,159 --> 00:37:52,639
our year-end bonuses will double.

541
00:38:14,679 --> 00:38:16,159
Just let this go.

542
00:38:16,199 --> 00:38:17,320
Listen to me this once.

543
00:38:17,920 --> 00:38:19,400
You know Deep Sea's code.

544
00:38:20,039 --> 00:38:22,000
We're not allowed to mistreat prisoners.

545
00:38:22,079 --> 00:38:24,039
These prisoners were going to ambush us.

546
00:38:24,039 --> 00:38:24,880
That's why I did it.

547
00:38:24,880 --> 00:38:25,760
You know that.

548
00:38:26,000 --> 00:38:27,039
This war...

549
00:38:27,679 --> 00:38:29,400
isn't your personal playground.

550
00:38:35,039 --> 00:38:36,920
Are you really being this cold-hearted?

551
00:38:38,199 --> 00:38:40,079
Since you know Deep Sea's rules,

552
00:38:40,760 --> 00:38:42,039
you should know the consequences.

553
00:38:42,039 --> 00:38:45,199
Hades, rein in the demon inside you.

554
00:38:45,679 --> 00:38:46,880
It'll get you killed.

555
00:38:47,360 --> 00:38:48,760
I can't leave Deep Sea.

556
00:38:49,079 --> 00:38:51,000
I still have Sasha and my child.

557
00:38:51,239 --> 00:38:52,599
That's not what you're afraid of.

558
00:38:54,079 --> 00:38:57,079
I see something else in your eyes.

559
00:38:58,039 --> 00:39:00,320
And you've already gotten them killed.

560
00:39:06,559 --> 00:39:07,360
Wei Tian,

561
00:39:08,079 --> 00:39:10,559
your sense of justice once ruined me.

562
00:39:10,880 --> 00:39:11,519
Now...

563
00:39:11,519 --> 00:39:14,599
I'll make you pay a far heavier price.

564
00:39:15,559 --> 00:39:17,199
Is your life more important,

565
00:39:17,199 --> 00:39:18,360
or someone else's?

566
00:39:19,199 --> 00:39:20,679
I'll let you choose.

567
00:39:24,559 --> 00:39:25,639
It's your turn now.

568
00:39:45,360 --> 00:39:47,679
Africa's economy has huge growth potential

569
00:39:48,840 --> 00:39:50,360
and is favored worldwide.

570
00:39:51,360 --> 00:39:53,400
Companies and people from many nations

571
00:39:53,840 --> 00:39:56,119
came to Africa to pursue great ambitions,

572
00:39:56,679 --> 00:39:58,360
and China is no exception.

573
00:39:59,119 --> 00:40:00,079
As we all know,

574
00:40:00,960 --> 00:40:02,440
China and Africa

575
00:40:03,039 --> 00:40:05,199
share a deep traditional friendship

576
00:40:05,760 --> 00:40:08,840
spanning over half a century.

577
00:40:09,679 --> 00:40:12,320
As Chinese enterprises grow in Africa,

578
00:40:13,199 --> 00:40:14,719
more Chinese people will

579
00:40:15,360 --> 00:40:17,480
come to Africa to live and work.

580
00:40:18,360 --> 00:40:19,400
We at Zhong'an Group

581
00:40:19,920 --> 00:40:23,280
aim to build a security shield

582
00:40:23,639 --> 00:40:25,280
to protect Chinese enterprises

583
00:40:25,280 --> 00:40:27,639
and Chinese citizens' lives and property.

584
00:41:03,159 --> 00:41:03,960
Mr. Xiang.

585
00:41:04,360 --> 00:41:05,559
Xiao Liu, where are you?

586
00:41:05,559 --> 00:41:06,639
I'm in the lobby.

587
00:41:06,960 --> 00:41:08,280
What time is our train today?

588
00:41:12,559 --> 00:41:13,159
Ten o'clock.

589
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:16,280
Okay, then we'll leave in an hour.

590
00:41:16,599 --> 00:41:17,039
Alright.

591
00:41:26,880 --> 00:41:28,639
Target is heading to the train station.

592
00:41:28,880 --> 00:41:30,480
Car seven, Seat 17.

593
00:41:46,480 --> 00:41:47,280
Captain.

594
00:41:48,840 --> 00:41:50,840
The food tastes a bit weird today.

595
00:41:55,880 --> 00:41:57,719
It's fine. What does it taste like?

596
00:41:59,199 --> 00:42:00,400
Don't you taste...

597
00:42:00,840 --> 00:42:01,960
...a hint of job-hopping?

598
00:42:06,599 --> 00:42:07,760
How did you know?

599
00:42:09,320 --> 00:42:10,320
I've seen you all morning,

600
00:42:10,599 --> 00:42:11,840
watching that guy's videos.

601
00:42:12,519 --> 00:42:15,079
And now you've moved this over here.

602
00:42:17,119 --> 00:42:18,480
Are you thinking of joining...

603
00:42:18,480 --> 00:42:19,920
...the ever-growing Zhong'an?

604
00:42:20,159 --> 00:42:21,119
Stop talking nonsense.

605
00:42:21,599 --> 00:42:22,400
Let me tell you,

606
00:42:22,519 --> 00:42:23,920
Xiang Lai really did come to see me.

607
00:42:23,920 --> 00:42:25,159
But I turned him down.

608
00:42:27,960 --> 00:42:28,760
Where's Sha Lan?

609
00:42:29,400 --> 00:42:30,519
Xiang Lai asked her out.

610
00:42:36,679 --> 00:42:37,480
The way I see it,

611
00:42:37,719 --> 00:42:38,599
we really need to foster...

612
00:42:38,599 --> 00:42:40,079
...some team solidarity.

613
00:42:40,480 --> 00:42:41,639
We can't keep being so disorganized...

614
00:42:41,639 --> 00:42:42,519
...and undisciplined.

615
00:42:43,639 --> 00:42:44,639
Whenever someone...

616
00:42:45,159 --> 00:42:46,679
...offers a few petty perks,

617
00:42:47,159 --> 00:42:49,000
people get swayed so easily...

618
00:42:49,360 --> 00:42:50,480
...and do their bidding for nothing.

619
00:42:51,639 --> 00:42:53,000
No, I think...

620
00:42:53,000 --> 00:42:54,639
...we should hold back a bit.

621
00:42:55,039 --> 00:42:55,480
Right?

622
00:42:56,039 --> 00:42:58,400
Wait until they offer top dollar,

623
00:42:58,400 --> 00:42:59,639
and then we decide...

624
00:42:59,639 --> 00:43:01,320
...whether to do their bidding.

625
00:43:01,760 --> 00:43:04,159
Captain, we're Security Officers!

626
00:43:04,239 --> 00:43:06,199
Have some professional pride, will you?

627
00:43:09,639 --> 00:43:10,639
How about this?

628
00:43:10,639 --> 00:43:12,159
Why don't we lower our rates...

629
00:43:12,159 --> 00:43:13,480
...just a little bit?

630
00:43:13,800 --> 00:43:15,880
So we can compete with Zhong'an.

631
00:43:16,159 --> 00:43:18,280
Are you guys that broke?

632
00:43:20,280 --> 00:43:21,519
If you need money, go to Zhong'an.

633
00:43:21,960 --> 00:43:23,280
Zhong'an needs talent,

634
00:43:23,679 --> 00:43:24,960
and they pay very well.

635
00:43:28,000 --> 00:43:28,480
Hey, you...

636
00:43:32,119 --> 00:43:32,960
The way things are going,

637
00:43:33,039 --> 00:43:34,199
we, the Silent Protectors,

638
00:43:34,280 --> 00:43:35,679
are turning into a Zhong'an branch.
